  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Mukuru Promotion CentreProject Title:  &#x2018;Economic Empowerment Initiative for Vulnerable youths, Women and persons with disability&#x2019; Project Objective: To support economic empowerment for most vulnerable groups (youths, women and people with disability) in Mukuru informal settlement Project Activities: Business skills training for 20 identified beneficiaries, business ideas incubation and selection process, disbursement of seed grants and supporting beneficiaries to set up identified businesses, follow up of beneficiaries through social workers to provide moral and technical support to beneficiaries</narrative>
